      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/20119100-1677546338.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "It's alright, it feels like overcooked but with a warehouse. If you're coming from Peak, IMO while it is more polished it is also more \"limited\" and you'll quick get the whole it has to offer even before you finish all the levels, still had some fun worth it it's price for sure."
    },
